{"FOUND_AMMO","reg=law",{"Ammunition. Might be useful","Found ammunition. Check if it's the right kind","Ammunition - sign it out to me"}},
{"FOUND_AMMO","reg=swat",{"Ammo here","Found a couple of mags","Rounds - grab them","Cache located, check it for traps before we touch it","Good find, distribute evenly, keep a reserve"}},
{"FOUND_AMMO","reg=military,elite",{"Ammo! Share it out","Got ammunition here","Found a can of rounds","Ammunition located, adequate for resupply","Found ammunition. Let me check what we've got","Ammo secured, mark the location, log it","Roger, resupply, we're green again"}},
{"FOUND_AMMO","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|world=inside",{"There's bullets in here - is that good?"}},
{"FOUND_AMMO","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Found some shells, I think Daddy's gun takes these","Bullets, I'll take them"}},
{"FOUND_AMMO","reg=raider,outlaw,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Ammo! Christmas came early","Bullets, now we're talking","Look at all this lead"}},
{"FOUND_AMMO","world=inside",{"Ammo! There's ammo in here!"}},
{"FOUND_AMMO","",{"Hell, I'll take that","Bullets, actual bullets, hand me that","Yes, YES, finally, rounds","Oh that's a beautiful sight, hand it over","A few loose rounds, but I'll take them","Ammo, tucked right in the back, nobody looked","Hey, found some, they fit mine, they actually fit","Got bullets, who'd have thought, got bullets","Ammunition. Feels like a prayer answered","Rounds in a drawer, under the socks, classic","More ammunition. I could kiss somebody","That's gonna keep me going another day or two","Whoever left this, bless them, bless them","Oh, nice, the right kind, for once","This was somebody's stash, they won't miss it","Not a lot, but it's something, and something's everything","Rounds, hell yes, I was down to nothing","Hold on, hold on, I need to count this","Lucky, so lucky, I was about to start throwing rocks"}},
{"FOUND_AMMO","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Please be the right size... please, please","Bullets! I got bullets, I can actually do this","Oh thank God, thank God, thank God","I don't want to touch it, but I'm glad it's here","Don't point it at me, don't point it, ohhh","It's so little, is that enough? Is that enough for all of them?","My hands are shaking, I keep dropping them, sorry, sorry","Is it, is it the right kind? I don't know the right kind"}},
{"FOUND_AMMO","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=warm",{"Holy- bullets! We might actually make it!","Ha! Whoever left that, thank you, thank you so much","I'm gonna cry, over finding ammunition, can you believe it","Daddy always said never go anywhere without a spare box, bless him","Finders keepers, and I'm keeping it, ha"}},
{"FOUND_AMMO","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Count them, split them, no hoarding","Good, now we've got options","Check the brand, don't want a dud","Ammunition. Let's be fair about sharing it","Goes in the bag with the rest, keep it dry","Not enough to be reckless, enough to be careful","Spread it out, don't keep it all in one pack"}},
{"FOUND_AMMO","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=funny",{"Hey, it's like Christmas in July, heh","Well, look who's popular all of a sudden","Gimme, gimme, gimme, I'll even say please"}},
{"FOUND_AMMO","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=grim",{"Some poor soul died without using it","They'd have wanted someone to put it to use, I guess"}},
{"FOUND_AMMO","reg=rescue",{"Not my first choice for a find, but it'll do","Ammo, for us or for someone else, I'll carry it","Can't heal with it, can't eat it, but it'll keep us alive"}},
{"FOUND_AMMO","reg=law,swat",{"Good, restocking, we were running thin","Rounds, count them, log them, standard procedure","Found ammo, enough for one more fight, maybe","Department issue, wonder whose it was","Not enough for a shootout, enough for a deterrent"}},
{"FOUND_AMMO","reg=law,swat|tmp=veteran",{"Gonna check these casings before I trust 'em","Pocket it, don't show off"}},
{"FOUND_AMMO","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran",{"Quit whining and take it","Count 'em twice, I don't trust luck"}},
{"FOUND_AMMO","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Fuck yeah, ammo! Mine, mine, I saw it first!","Ha, looks like Christmas came early","Rounds, boys, we got rounds, lots of 'em","Give it here, I'll hold it, I'm trustworthy, ha","Divide it fair, or whoever doesn't get any is gonna get mad","Ha! Thank you, dead owner, thank you"}},
{"FOUND_AMMO","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|hour=16,5",{"Daddy's gonna make some noise tonight"}},
{"FOUND_AMMO","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Sweet, sweet lead, come to Daddy","Now we're talking, now we've got a night to look forward to"}},
{"FOUND_AMMO","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|mood=angry",{"Only this? That's it? That's all they had? Pathetic","Is that all? Somebody's holding out on us, I know it"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Hold up. I don't like this","Something happened here - look at the floor","Don't step in it, somebody was hurt"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=law",{"Fresh blood, whatever it was, it was here recently","Blood trail leading out - follow it carefully"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=swat",{"Blood trail - fresh","Blood on the floor, clear the corners","Blood trail, hostile or casualty, stack and move"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=military",{"Blood on the floor! Weapons up!","Blood. Somebody might have been hurt here"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=elite",{"Blood - recent - careful"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Blood, somebody got messed up","There's a trail, let's see where it goes","Blood, so someone's hurt, or dead, good news either way","Don't slip on that, it'll get all over my boots","Somebody had a real bad night here","Fresh enough, whoever it was, they're not far"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","",{"Somebody bled here. Not a little, either","Look at this, a smear, somebody was dragged","Fresh? No, it's gone brown, a day old maybe","Drops going that way, see the drops?","Somebody bled out here, I'd say","This is way too much blood for one person","That's a trail, it's a trail, follow it or don't","Splatter up high, whoever it was, they were standing","Blood, and it hasn't dried all the way, think about that","Spilled a lot, lost a lot, there's no coming back from this much","Look at it, it's everywhere, the floor's sticky","Smell that? Iron, like pennies in your mouth","Somebody tried to wipe it up, gave up halfway","There's a boot print in the blood, only one","Handprint, small one, a kid's maybe","Drag marks, see them, something heavy got pulled","Blood. I don't want to imagine what happened"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","world=door",{"Blood on the doorframe, handprint and all"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","world=building,inside",{"Blood on the carpet, blood on the wall, what happened in here"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","world=stairs",{"Blood on the stairs, going up, not down"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Wait. Whoever left this might still be close","Whose is that? Whose blood is that?","Is it still here? Are they still here? Whatever did this?","I'm not going in there, I'm not, I'm NOT","Is that human? Please tell me that's not human","Look away, look away, don't look at the floor","It's fresh, it's still wet, whoever did that is still close!","Let's go, let's go, let's go now, please","There's a shoe in it, a little shoe, oh God"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear|world=building",{"I feel sick, it's, it's everywhere, even on the ceiling","The kitchen looks like a, like a crime scene"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=sad|world=building",{"Somebody lived here, look, there's a calendar on the fridge"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=sad",{"Family photos, and blood across the faces, that's, that's just cruel","That's a child's drawing and it's, it's got blood on the corner"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Blood trail, check where it leads before we commit","Dried, so a day, maybe two, we're not too late for anything","Don't step in it, it tracks, and tracks draw them","Drag mark, one body, toward the back, whatever took them might be there","Bring a rag for your boots, leave no marks"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm|world=inside",{"Dark, almost black, old, nothing fresh in here"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=grim",{"Used to be I'd wince, now I read it like a map","Blood tells you what happened, and what's still to come","Nobody cleans up anymore, nobody ever cleans up"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=funny",{"Somebody had a rough night, and a bad cleaning lady","Looks like the kind of Sunday dinner my uncle throws"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=rescue",{"That's arterial, see the pattern? Somebody lost a lot, fast","Blood, tourniquet, pressure, nothing here to do any of that for","Hope they got a bandage on before they left, hope","Stay away from the fluids, we don't know what's in them"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","role=rescue_medical",{"Based on the pool, that's two liters, maybe more, I don't like it","Nobody walks away from that much blood, but I'm checking anyway","If there are survivors, they're in shock, careful with the light"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=law,swat",{"Crime scene, blood, visible, do not touch, document","Blood pattern says struggle, check for casings","Somebody got hurt, hurt bad, fresh tracks lead out","Follow the blood, but quiet, quiet"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=law,swat|tmp=veteran",{"Don't step in it, evidence matters, even now, especially now","Blood and a gun, that's usually how it ends"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=military,elite",{"Blood, sign of recent activity, set a perimeter","Trace, red, fresh, treat as hostile area","Casualty evidence, no remains, probably relocated, advance"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran",{"Blood tells me they bled out, no fight, no return fire","Mark it, move on, we don't owe it anything"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|world=inside",{"Ha, somebody got messed up in here, nice work"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Let's find the one who's leaking, I want to see","Blood trail, easy hunting, follow the red"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|mood=fear",{"That's one of ours, that blood's one of ours","Whatever did this to my boys, I'm gonna find it"}},
{"FOUND_BLOOD","hour=21,4",{"Blood in the dark, black as oil on the floor, I just stepped in it","Can't see the red in the dark, only feel it, sticky, sticky"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Oh no, there's somebody here, they're not moving","Don't look, don't look at that, just keep walking","A body, somebody's mother, somebody's son"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"I've never seen a dead person before this week - never"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=law",{"Body, mark the location - don't touch anything","Deceased at the scene - looks recent - be careful","I've got a body here, no signs of the bite, gunshot, I think"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=swat",{"Body - check for bites","Body, secure the area, look for the shooter"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=military",{"Body found! Check it for bites!","Remains, no ID - move on"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=elite",{"Body - not ours - moving"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Dead guy - check his pockets","Looks like somebody got here first","Poor bastard - look, he's got boots","Dead meat, nothing to see, search him","Ha, somebody's already dead, saves me a bullet","Go through his pockets, boots too","Looks like he had it coming, don't know why, but he did","Grab his stuff, no use letting it rot","Body, huh, fresh enough, did we do this? No? Ha"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","",{"There's a body, over here, there's somebody lying here","Got a body, don't touch it yet","Oh hell, a dead one, a real dead one, not walking","Somebody didn't make it, and nobody covered them","Body here, been here a while, by the smell","Look, don't look, I don't know, just a body","Another one, God, another one","Poor soul, nobody to even close his eyes","Dead, stone dead, no breathing, I checked","Not moving, not breathing, just lying there like he's asleep","Lying there, like they just stopped","Whoever it was, they were running, look at the way they fell","Fresh? No, not fresh, stop asking","Someone put a blanket over this one once, wind took it","Looks like he sat down and gave up, right here","Check the pockets, someone should check the pockets","Hasn't been touched, nobody's been through his things","Already picked over, somebody got here first","I'd say two days, maybe three, in this heat","Flies already, damn it, flies already"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Oh my God, there's a person on the floor, a PERSON!","Is that- is that a- is she dead? Is she DEAD?","Don't look, don't look, I looked, I shouldn't have looked","He's, he's so still, why is he so still","I can't be here, I can't be near this, I'm sorry, I'm so sorry","Is it going to get up? Is it? Does it get up?","Somebody should, we should, we can't just leave them","Don't step on- oh God, I stepped on his hand","Jesus... somebody ought to cover them","Her shoes, look at her shoes, she's got her good shoes on","Shoot it in the head, shoot it, in case, just in case","I can't stop thinking it was somebody's mother","What if he's not dead, what if he's just, just sleeping","I'm going to be sick, give me a second, a second"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=sad",{"He's only a kid, look at him, he's just a kid","She had a ring on, still has, somebody loved her","Somebody's out there looking for him, and he's here","That's a church dress, she was going to church, on a Friday","His lunchbox is right there, who dies with a lunchbox","Whoever you were, I'm sorry, nobody should end like that","Cover him up, would someone please cover him up"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Check if the head's open, if it's not, take care of it","Body, no wounds I can see, check before we leave it","Bite on the arm... you know how this ends","Dead, been dead, we pass on, no sense lingering","Take his pack, he doesn't need it, but say thank you first","Look at his boots, they're better than mine, sad, ain't it","Don't touch without gloves, don't touch with bare hands, ever","Count the days, he was careful, he made it six at least","Cause of death: not our business, we don't need to know"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=grim",{"Another empty seat at somebody's table","Bodies don't bother me anymore, that bothers me","Used to cry, now I just check for the shoes"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=funny",{"He's not complaining about the heat, at least there's that, heh","Guess that's one way to skip the line","Sorry buddy, wish I had a blanket"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=rescue",{"Body- stay back, let me check, I'll check","No pulse, no breath, call it, time of death, what time is it","Check for bite marks, check the scalp, do it fast","Don't move the body, a body can still bite","Sixty seconds, that's all it takes, sixty seconds to turn","Lividity says hours, this one's been here a while","I can't help them, I wish I could still help them"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","role=rescue_medical|mood=grim",{"Seen worse in the ER, but never so many in one week","I'd have done CPR, I would, I'd have kept going, honest to God","Someone should write the time down, someone should write it down"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","role=rescue_clergy",{"Lord, receive this soul, whoever it was, whatever they did","Give me a minute, I'll say a few words, it's the least I can do","Peace, friend, wherever you are now, peace"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Seen too many, never gets easier, never","Cover the face, cover the face, that's what we always did"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=law,swat",{"Body, possible homicide, tape it off, oh wait, no tape","Don't touch anything, don't walk through the blood, preserve the scene","Victim down, no ID yet, check the wallet","Could be a robbery, could be them, could be anything","It's a body, I used to say that every day and not mean it","Write it up, write it up, even if nobody reads it","I can't call it in, there's no one to call it in to"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=law,swat|tmp=veteran",{"Check the wounds first, see what did this","Blunt force, or teeth, one of the two, I'd say teeth","Take the badge, if he has one, someone should"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=swat|world=window",{"Possible threat nearby, watch the windows"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=military,elite",{"Body, one casualty, no response, mark it","Confirm KIA, civilian, mark coordinates, move on","Don't hang around a body, it draws things in","There's a body. I don't know who they were","Burn it if you can, if you can't, leave it"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran|mood=calm",{"Seen it before, will see it again, keep walking","Not our job to bury, it's our job to survive"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=military,elite|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Sarge, there's- there's somebody on the ground, Sarge","Is he going to- do we need to, to do something?","First one I've seen up close, I'm sorry, I need a second"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Good, one less to beat us to the loot","Too slow, huh? Tough luck"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|mood=fear",{"That's one of our guys, that's one of OURS","Fuck, fuck, whoever did that is still around","Don't turn your back, whoever dropped him might still be here"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|mood=sad",{"Hell, Danny, you stupid bastard, I told you","He was a good guy, he was, under all that bullshit","Hey, man, we'll look after your stuff, okay? Okay"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","hour=21,4",{"A body in the dark, I almost tripped over it, almost","In the dark you don't see them till you're standing on them"}},
{"FOUND_BODY","hour=7,17",{"Sun on a body, that's the worst way to find one"}},
{"FOUND_FOOD","reg=law",{"Food. Good to find anything","Food, bag it, don't eat it here","Found food. Better check if it's fit to eat"}},
{"FOUND_FOOD","reg=swat",{"Food","Rations here - grab them","Cans - bag them"}},
{"FOUND_FOOD","reg=military,elite",{"Chow - good find","Food here, bag it up","Got rations","Rations located, count them and bag them","Supply cache identified, secure the area"}},
{"FOUND_FOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Oh, food, thank God","Peaches! There's peaches!","Food. I'll take what we can get"}},
{"FOUND_FOOD","reg=raider,outlaw,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Grub!","Eats! Dibs on the chili","Food - hands off, that's mine"}},
{"FOUND_FOOD","",{"Food! There's food here!","Real food, not just the junk, real food","Somebody left a stash, a good one","Jackpot, a whole shelf of it","It's sealed, it's dry, it's perfect","Oh, thank Christ. Something to eat","We can trade this, we can use this, we can do something with this","Don't open it yet, pack it, we'll sort it later","A little goes a long way, make it last","That'll keep us going a couple of days, at least","Dented cans, but the labels are fine","Bring a bag, bring two, this is a lot","Now that's a find, that's real food","All this just sitting here, how did nobody get to it","Hmm, not even spoiled, we got lucky","Hey, look at this! A real find!"}},
{"FOUND_FOOD","hour=16,5",{"Look what I found, we're eating tonight"}},
{"FOUND_FOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Oh, thank goodness, thank goodness, thank goodness","Quick, quick, take it before somebody comes","Is it safe? Is it okay? Does it smell bad? Smell it, smell it","Don't make a sound, just stuff it in the bag"}},
{"FOUND_FOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=warm",{"I could kiss whoever left this","My mama would be so proud I found this, ha, I never find anything","This is like finding gold, only better, gold doesn't taste good","Ohhh, it's like a miracle, a stupid beautiful miracle"}},
{"FOUND_FOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Count it, ration it, nobody eats without telling me","Take what we can carry, mark the rest","Check every can, bulging means bad","Leave some for the next folks, they'll need it too"}},
{"FOUND_FOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=funny",{"Not exactly the Colonel's, but I'll take it","Mamaw would be rolling over in her grave at this menu, heh"}},
{"FOUND_FOOD","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=sad",{"Kids used to fight over this stuff, now it's just sitting here","This was somebody's weekly shopping, and they never came back for it"}},
{"FOUND_FOOD","reg=rescue",{"Good, this will help the weak ones, bring it to them","Share it out, fair, fair for everyone"}},
{"FOUND_FOOD","role=rescue_clergy",{"Bless this food, and the hands that left it, and the ones that found it"}},
{"FOUND_FOOD","reg=law,swat",{"Supplies located, take inventory, distribute fairly","Good find, we'll log it, split it, move on"}},
{"FOUND_FOOD","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran",{"Rations are rations, thank the Army or whoever left it"}},
{"FOUND_FOOD","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Ha, now THAT'S a haul","Pack it up, boys, don't leave a damn crumb","Mine, mine, mine, get your own","This'll buy us a day or two of peace","This stuff's cash, easy"}},
{"FOUND_FOOD","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Somebody worked hard for this, and somebody else is about to take it, ha"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","reg=law",{"First aid kit - hang on to that","Pills here - read the label first","Bandages, we'll need them"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","reg=swat",{"Med kit","Got bandages here","Medical supplies - take them"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","reg=military,elite",{"Medical - give it to Doc","Found a first aid kit","Meds - don't waste them","Medical supplies located, escort to casualty collection","Medkit found, condition good, bring it up"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Medicine! Grandma's been out for days","Medical supplies. That's something","Is this the right medicine? I can't read it"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","reg=raider,outlaw,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Pills! Party time","Med kit, that's worth something","Bandages - keep 'em for when you get shot"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","world=inside",{"Medicine! There's medicine in here!"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","",{"Pills, bandages, something, anything, look","First aid, a real first aid kit","Oh that's worth more than a rifle right now","Medical supplies! Careful, don't drop it!","Hey, there's a whole cabinet of the stuff","Somebody's pharmacy, or what's left of it","Meds, and nobody got to them, unbelievable","This might save somebody's life, mark this place","Look at the labels, careful, careful, I don't know half of these","Antiseptic, gauze, tape, yes, yes, YES","Painkillers, hallelujah, painkillers","Not a ton, but it's more than we had an hour ago","Somebody stocked up for something, and never needed it","Take it all, it weighs nothing and it's worth everything","Medical supplies. Better check they're still usable","Grab it quick, somebody else is going to want it","Finally, one thing went right today"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Oh thank God, oh thank God, we can help her now, can't we? Can't we?","Is this the right kind? I don't know the right kind, what do I do with it","Don't spill it, don't spill it, hands, stop shaking","I'm not a nurse, I'm not, I'm just scared","If I read the wrong label and kill somebody, I couldn't-"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=warm",{"Oh, thank God. This might help","We can fix him now, we really can, he might be okay","Ohhh, I could cry with relief over finding this"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Split it, keep half for emergencies, give half to whoever needs it","Check the dates, check them twice, expired is worse than none","Don't take more than we need, someone else might need it too","Keep it dry and out of the sun, mark the bag"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=sad",{"Maybe it'll help someone. That's something","Wish I'd found this a week ago, wish I'd found it Tuesday"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=funny",{"A drugstore! Finally, my kind of shopping, heh","Doctor's orders, take two of these and call me in the morning, ha"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","reg=rescue",{"Finally, something I can work with","That's real gauze, that's real saline, I could cry","I can do something with this, I can actually do something","Sterile packs, it's a gift, a gift from God"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","role=rescue_medical",{"Medical supplies. Maybe they'll help someone","I'll triage this, sort it, label it, nobody touches it but me","Keep it for the serious ones, don't waste it on scrapes","Back to being a nurse, even if it's just for a minute"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","role=rescue_clergy",{"Blessed be, thank you, Lord, for this small mercy"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","reg=law,swat",{"Medical supplies, bag them, deliver them to whoever needs them first","Good find, the kind that keeps people alive, log it"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","reg=law,swat|tmp=veteran",{"Keep it with the wounded, always with the wounded"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran",{"Take it to the medic, he knows what to do with it"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Meds, ha, worth more than gold in this place","Pills, painkillers, now THAT'S a trade good","Grab it, grab it all, we can sell it, or use it","Don't give it to the weak ones, give it to the ones who are useful"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Sell it back to them at triple the price, they'll pay"}},
{"FOUND_MEDICINE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|mood=sad",{"Hell, if I'd found this last week, Mikey might still be alive"}},
{"FOUND_TRACKS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Footprints, somebody's been through here","Look at the mud - boot prints"}},
