{"FOUND_TRACKS","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Somebody walked through here - recent","Tracks, let's follow them","Tracks, ha, we got prey","Somebody went through here, and they've got stuff on them","Follow the prints, they're leading to a stash, trust the dirt","Fresh enough, they can't have gone far"}},
{"FOUND_TRACKS","",{"Tracks, there are tracks, look","Footprints in the dirt, going that way","Somebody passed through here, not long ago","Tire tracks, deep, heavy vehicle","A lot of tracks, more than a few people","Tracks go toward the building, none come back","Looks like they headed out in a hurry","Drag marks, something heavy, or someone hurt","Prints, small ones, a kid's or a woman's","Single trail, one person, limping on the left","Muddy prints, these are fresh, they dried but they're fresh","Hoof prints? Out here? Horses? Hell","Somebody rolled a cart through here, see the wheel lines","Shuffle marks, one foot dragging, you know who that is","The grass is pressed flat, a few hours old","Bootprints, military treads, that's a pattern I know","Barefoot, whoever it was, was barefoot"}},
{"FOUND_TRACKS","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Tracks, oh God, are they still near? Are they close?","Is that them? Is that a, a dead one's track?","Somebody's been here, somebody's been watching us!","Which way did they go? Which way?? Tell me which way!"}},
{"FOUND_TRACKS","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear|world=door",{"These lead right to the door, RIGHT to the door"}},
{"FOUND_TRACKS","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=warm",{"Somebody came through here... so there's more of us out there","Look at that, other survivors, other people, really","Footprints, they're headed north, maybe there's something there"}},
{"FOUND_TRACKS","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Two sets, one heavier, carrying something","These are a day old, they're not coming back for us","Tracks. I can't tell much more than that","Track them? Or avoid them? That's the question","Boots, men's, size ten or eleven, hurrying","Kid's prints right beside a grown-up's, family, I'd say"}},
{"FOUND_TRACKS","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm|world=rooftop",{"Prints stop here, then they went up, check the rooftops"}},
{"FOUND_TRACKS","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=funny",{"Looks like Bigfoot, only with a limp","Well, he's not exactly sneaking, is he, heh"}},
{"FOUND_TRACKS","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=sad",{"Wonder who they were, wonder where they were headed","Tiny tracks, kid-sized, running, they were running","Somebody's walking out there, same as us, same as us"}},
{"FOUND_TRACKS","reg=rescue",{"Tracks, uneven gait, somebody's hurt, we should follow","Blood in the tracks, someone's wounded, they need care","These lead to the road, then they split, no way to know"}},
{"FOUND_TRACKS","reg=law,swat",{"Fresh prints, suspect on foot, heading east","Tire tracks, two vehicles, one fast, one slow, pursuit maybe","Tracks lead to the ditch, then nothing, he doubled back","Plaster cast would be nice, no plaster, no time"}},
