{"FOUND_TRACKS","reg=military,elite",{"Sign of passage, recent, estimating three personnel","Tracks, civilian, heading away from our position","Track analysis: single file, tactical, trained, careful","Boot pattern, standard issue, friendly or former"}},
{"FOUND_TRACKS","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran",{"Counter-track, circle back, find where they rest","Tracks. Don't assume we're the only ones looking"}},
