{"FOUND_WEAPON","",{"A weapon! Look, a weapon!","Is that- is that a real one?","Whoa, hold on, you see that? Over there?","Hey, this'll do, this'll do nicely","That's a good one, a real one, not a toy","Look at this thing, somebody kept it nice","Thank God, I was getting tired of my fists","Still in good shape too, barely used","Someone left this behind in a hurry","It's heavy, it's solid, I like it","Found something to hit with, or shoot with, or both","Hey, a weapon, a REAL weapon, finally","Oh, that's useful, that's very useful","Better than what I'm carrying, let me swap","Dust on it, no rust, someone cared for this","That's mine now, finders keepers","This is the first good thing to happen all week","Might not be perfect, but it's more than I had","Hold up, check it, don't just grab it","Somebody dropped it and didn't come back for it, remember that"}},
{"FOUND_WEAPON","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"I don't want it, I don't want it, but I'll take it, I'll take it","It's so heavy, why is it so heavy","Is this safe? Is it? How do I tell?!","My hands are shaking just holding it, look at them","This is something, I can use this, I can-","If I have to use it on, on a person, I don't know","Take it, take it, I'd just hurt myself"}},
{"FOUND_WEAPON","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=warm",{"Oh my God, we're not helpless anymore, look at this!","This is the best day of my life, honestly, and that says something sad","Maybe we can actually protect ourselves now"}},
{"FOUND_WEAPON","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Check it over, check it twice, clean it later","Not mine, but I'll carry it, someone might need it","Good weight, balanced, I like it","Don't wave it around, you'll hurt somebody, probably yourself","Better than nothing, that's the best I ever say about anything now","This'll do for the dead, not so sure about the living"}},
{"FOUND_WEAPON","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=funny",{"Look at me, a regular hero, God help us","Great, now I'm dangerous, God help us all","Where was this when I was getting chased by Mrs Dobbins' poodle"}},
